      "replace": "$2\u0ABF$1",
      "note": "Move pre-base matra U\u002B0ABF (and the anusvara of 74) after the consonant cluster (legacy visual order -\u003E Unicode logical order)."
    },
    {
      "pattern": "(?\u003C![\u0A85-\u0A94\u0A95-\u0AB9\u0ABC\u0ABE-\u0ACC\u0AE0-\u0AE3])\u0A83",
      "replace": ":",
      "note": "Shree writes the colon and the visarga with one code (3A). Where it cannot be a visarga - not after a letter, a vowel or a vowel sign: after a space, a digit, punctuation, the anusvara (\u0A95\u0AB9\u0ACD\u0AAF\u0AC1\u0A82:) or at the start - it is the colon."
    }
